Source: sparky-stereo-midi
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Daniel Ramos (Capitain Jack) <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), pkg-config, libfluidsynth-dev (>= 2.6.1), libpipewire-0.3-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.4
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://sparkylinux.org

Package: sparky-stereo-midi
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: FluidSynth renderer that releases audio while idle
 MIDI remains available while the native PipeWire audio driver is absent.
 Notes retain their order and relative times across audio startup.
 Voices and effects render until their output is below half a 24-bit step.
